    }(name='syncScope', description='Follows the definition of the department-based synchronization scope. If omitted during creation, the default is AllAuthorized. The initial provider synchronization is determined by syncOnBind. If omitted or set to null during an update, the original value is retained. Updating and saving the scope does not automatically execute a full synchronization.'),
